8536+ 8396              ; data_available_in_module_file:
8537+ 8396              ; NZ/NC = HL available data (clamped to download_length).
8538+ 8396              ; Z/NC = closed socket with no queued bytes; Z/C = user pressed B.
8539+ 8396              ; Temporary emptiness is paced and retried, never treated as EOF.
8540+ 8396              ; Empty polls wait until data, confirmed closure or B; AT query replies remain bounded.
8541+ 8396              ; Changes AF/BC/DE/HL. Directory polling above keeps its own completion policy.
